00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,740
靠边停
Uh, pull over.

333
00:17:06,070 --> 00:17:07,660
什么  怎么了  你给谁打电话呢
What? Why? Who are you calling?

334
00:17:08,410 --> 00:17:10,030
你要跟霍华德打小报告是不是
You're gonna rat me out to Howard, aren't you?

335
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,950
居然还会告密  难怪我一直看你不顺眼
You're such a snitch, no wonder I don't like you.

336
00:17:14,410 --> 00:17:17,330
我是打给我爸好吗
Whoa, I'm calling my dad, okay?

337
00:17:17,500 --> 00:17:19,710
他对孕妇们的事很有经验
He's got experience dealing with pregnant ladies

338
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,170
因为他是妇科医师
because he's an OBGYN.

339
00:17:21,550 --> 00:17:24,090
对付疯婆子也很有经验  因为有我妈
And experience with crazy ladies because of my mom.

340
00:17:26,510 --> 00:17:27,880
拉杰什
Hello, Rajesh.

341
00:17:28,260 --> 00:17:30,430
-你打电话是来要钱的吗  -什么  不是
-Are you calling to ask for money?  -What? No.

342
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:32,600
你打电话是来要需要花钱的东西吗
Are you calling to ask for things that cost money?

343
00:17:32,810 --> 00:17:34,930
-不是  -那很好  有何关照
-No.  -Great. What's up?

344
00:17:35,770 --> 00:17:37,810
这是我朋友  伯纳黛特
This is my friend, Bernadette.

345
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:40,310
她怀孕了  心里有些烦恼
She's pregnant, and she's a bit worried,

346
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,860
我想或许你能跟她聊聊
so I thought maybe you could talk to her.

347
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:44,360
当然可以  有什么烦恼
Of course. What seems to be the trouble?

348
00:17:44,780 --> 00:17:45,780
心里觉得有些怪怪的
Something's wrong.

349
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:49,910
我对孩子的东西毫无兴趣  不像其他妈妈那么痴迷
I don't care about any of the baby stuff every other mom is so into.

350
00:17:50,490 --> 00:17:53,160
说实话  我都不确定自己是否喜欢孩子
Honestly, I'm not even sure I like babies.

351
00:17:53,830 --> 00:17:57,620
听着  有些人喜欢小孩  有些人不喜欢小孩
Look, some people are baby people,and some people are not baby people.

352
00:17:58,210 --> 00:18:00,130
但这不代表你不爱自己的孩子啊
It doesn't mean you won't love your own baby.

353
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:03,000
我以为自己会更兴奋呢
But I thought I'd be more excited.

354
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:06,420
兴奋也不能保证什么啊
Oh, being excited isn't a guarantee of anything.

355
00:18:06,670 --> 00:18:09,590
拉杰什的妈妈怀他的时候  兴奋得不行
Rajesh's mother was thrilled when she was pregnant with him.

356
00:18:09,890 --> 00:18:12,930
他出生以后  一举一动都让她痴迷不已
After he was born, she doted on his every move.

357
00:18:13,100 --> 00:18:14,560
知道后来怎么了吗
And you know what happened?

358
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,680
他伤了妈妈的心  搬到地球另一端去
He broke her heart, moved halfway around the world,

359
00:18:16,850 --> 00:18:18,440
只跟穷酸的可怜白人姑娘约会
and dates only poor white women.

360
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:23,320
世事难料啊
So you never know.

361
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:26,150
谢谢您  我感觉好多了
Thank you. I feel better now.

362
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:27,740
我感觉不好
I don't!

363
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:30,990
很好  伯纳黛特  祝你生个千金
Good. Bernadette, I hope you have a daughter.

364
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:39,830
我不知道该怎么开口
Uh...I don't know how to say this.

365
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,000
可以试试用"长官"开头
Well, you could try starting with "sir".

366
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:44,040
对  对不起  长官
Right. Sorry, sir.

367
00:18:44,210 --> 00:18:46,460
他说的是开头  不是结尾
He said start with it, not end with it.

368
00:18:48,590 --> 00:18:49,590
长官
Sir...

369
00:18:50,010 --> 00:18:51,800
我们碰到了一些难关
We've hit a bit of a snag.

370
00:18:51,970 --> 00:18:53,680
赶不上计划时间了
We're already behind schedule.

371
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:58,180
计算需要克服的部署性问题要比我们之前预想的
The computations required to overcome the deployability issues

372
00:18:58,350 --> 00:19:00,520
要大了许多
are more significant than we thought.

373
00:19:00,690 --> 00:19:02,850
我知道我们签了合同
I understand that we're under contract,

374
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:05,690
不知道违反合同有什么后果
and I don't know what the consequences of violating that are,

375
00:19:05,860 --> 00:19:10,240
但是  我们没办法按保证的时间完成了
but, uh... we're not gonna be able to deliver in the time we promised.

376
00:19:17,290 --> 00:19:18,750
你们需要多久
How long do you need?

377
00:19:19,790 --> 00:19:23,790
我们估计...  两年吧
We-We're thinking... two years.

378
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:27,840
好的
All right.

379
00:19:29,970 --> 00:19:32,510
就这样  你愿意接受啊
That's it? You're okay with that?

380
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:35,010
你觉得你是第一个
You think you're the first government contractor

381
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:36,890
无法按时完成政府合同的人吗
who isn't gonna deliver on time?

382
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:39,430
我们还在等当年里根总统
We're still waiting for a big space laser Reagan ordered

383
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:40,980
订来打共产党的大宇宙镭射枪呢
to beat the commies.

384
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:44,690
感谢您的理解  长官
Thanks for understanding, sir.

385
00:19:44,850 --> 00:19:46,360
非常感谢
Yes, thank you so much.

386
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:48,650
我们真的很感激
We-We really appreciate it.

387
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:51,280
好了  没压力了
All right, pressure's off

388
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:53,360
要去看电影吗  爆米花我请
Wanna see a movie? Popcorn's on me.

